text He doesn't say anything, grabbing his bat silently and walking off.
text It's almost as if he's a man possessed...
text He enters the batter's box and glares straight at the pitcher like he's aiming for him.
text The first pitch is a fastball. He doesn't even flinch. Strike one.
text The second pitch is another fastball. He watches this one go by too for a second strike.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Is he looking for a breaking ball again? If so, the pitcher has him outsmarted...)
text The third pitch... is a slider that breaks to the outside.
text He doesn't swing at this one either.
text Pitch four... is a high fastball. It's a bait pitch.
text He watches it go by again.
text Two balls, two strikes.
text Time for pitch five.
text It's inside... another fastball.
text Yoshino Yusuke swings without hesitation. He was waiting for this exact fastball.
